sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Src as Camera / video
    participant Det as OnnxDetector (hazard + COCO)
    participant RM as ReportManager
    participant App as Detector app
    participant MD as MacroDroid macro
    participant Waze as Waze (or Mock Waze)

    loop every inference frame
        Src->>Det: frame (BGR)
        Det->>Det: letterbox, ONNX Runtime, NMS
        Det->>RM: detections (label, conf, bbox)
        RM->>RM: map label to hazard_type, count hits in last 10 frames
    end

    alt 3+ hits at conf >= 0.45 and no cooldown active
        RM->>App: HazardEvent (JSON)
        Note over RM,App: On phone: in-process. Pi variant: NDJSON over TCP :8765
        App->>MD: broadcast com.wazeomatic.HAZARD_DETECTED<br/>extras: hazard_type, confidence, ts, source, dry_run
        MD->>MD: hazard_type into local variable
        alt Waze not in foreground or report in last 60 s
            MD->>MD: stop, nothing tapped
        else eligible
            MD->>Waze: tap Report, category, subcategory
            alt DRY_RUN = true
                MD->>MD: screenshot, back out (no send)
            else live
                MD->>Waze: tap Report (send)
            end
        end
    else otherwise
        RM->>RM: keep counting (per-type 60 s, global 5 s cooldown)
    end
